        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our wireline units, we provide plug-and-perf services that, when combined with our fully-composite, hybrid, or dissolvable frac plugs, create perforations to isolate and divert the fracture to the correct stage.",
