        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also consider the quality and timely delivery of our products, the service we provide to our customers, and the technical knowledge and skill of our personnel to be more important than our registered intellectual property in our ability to compete.",
