        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that the principal competitive factors in the markets we serve are technology offerings, wellsite execution, service quality, technical expertise, equipment capacity, work force competency, efficiency, safety record, reputation, and experience.",
